    <div style="max-width:720px;text-align:center;">
      <h6 style="text-align:center;">246 Women and 119 have found hope here</h6>
      <p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">In the past 10 years, H.O.P.E. Village has graduated 246 women and 119 children into self-sufficiency.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
